  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra bốn điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> thẳng hàng.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lần l